WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:28.350
Sheryl and the others who had escaped from the Solo Ship

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.990
were captured by the Buff Clan.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:37.780
Harulu's underling Doku demanded the Ideon in exchange for the hostages.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.120
After a fierce fight in Ideon's cockpit,

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.290
Cosmo succeeded in retrieving the Ideon.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:49.330
But Sheryl and the others
who escaped from the Solo Ship

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.260
owed Karala a great debt.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:57.900
She alone took the blame for planning the desertion.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:04.610
The whole crew of the Solo
Ship are indebted to Karala.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:06.640
Damn it...

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.240
It's mortifying!

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:17.690
<b>Damido's Ultimate Strategy</b>

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.270
Isn't it okay if I go take a look at the meeting?

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.600
You're supposed to look after the kids.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.220
Aww, it's a pain having to deal with these babies.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:46.250
Oh, Lou, you can't behave like this.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.520
I've had enough. I'm not hanging
out with these kids anymore.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.670
Have you recovered from your wounds, Damido?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.870
Yes, nothing can prevent me from heading into battle.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.750
Two of my officers died
during your absence.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.440
Yes...

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:25.660
Since Gije has yet to return from Logo
Dau, you are the only one I can depend on.

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:28.330
Your kind words are more than I deserve.

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:31.820
I can't keep waiting forever for my father Doba to send reinforcements.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:37.420
When I think about the enemy preparing themselves at this very moment,

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.530
I simply cannot wait.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.520
It is as you say.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:46.240
I believe staking our lives in battle is the only way to break away from this stalemate.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.680
Return with good news.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:53.000
It's been a long time since my last sortie. My blood is already boiling.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.950
Hooks have been installed onto the Zero Zurows.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:03.530
Since the Zero Zurows are even more powerful than the Gil Baus...

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:07.150
We can definitely get
our hands on the Giant.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.300
Hooks have been installed?

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.350
This isn't going to be a suicide attack, is it?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:12.820
Sir Damido...

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:17.500
Be quiet!

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:22.670
Your courageous fighting will bring your family eternal prosperity!

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.400
Glory to the Buff Clan!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:28.200
Glory to the Buff Clan! Glory to the Buff Clan!

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:35.780
Aren't you going to install the Glenn Cannon before attaching the dome?

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.470
Do we have time to install it?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.620
Raise a spare Glenn Cannon to the upper deck!

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.670
Judging from the results of Cosmo and Kasha's brainwave analysis...

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:50.810
It looks like when the two of them feel
threatened, the Ideon Gauge's energy rises.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:55.010
Yes, and we can't ignore the relationship between the Solo Ship and Ideon.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:55.910
Indeed.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.850
Have you forgotten why
the Buff Clan is attacking us?

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:05.740
That's right. Once we understand the Ide, we don't need to care about the details.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:08.200
That's why we're having this discussion.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:12.590
This would all be over if you understood
the language of the Sixth Civilization.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:17.510
Well, why don't you take me to Earth? Then I'd be able to...

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:20.870
You've got to figure out the language
of the Sixth Civilization first!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.920
In any case, Ideon is Ideon.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.970
Let's just keep on doing things our way.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.680
That's right.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.200
But the Ideon is dependent on the Solo Ship.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.510
Your first priority should be to guard the Solo Ship.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:34.890
Isn't that what Cosmo has been doing?

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.860
This isn't the time for kids to be talking!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.370
I think you're right, Deck.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.400
Cosmo.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.750
On the battlefield, you should abide by the chain of command.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.170
From now on, follow my orders.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.830
But in the middle of a battle,

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:50.580
one should move based on their own decisions.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.170
I can't do everything the way you want.

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:54.470
C-Cosmo!

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:55.930
Cosmo is right.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:57.820
Those brats!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.680
Bes...

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:01.960
What will we do with them?

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:06.870
Zigg Macks, ready to launch!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.250
Open the hatch!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.450
Get into subspace formation!

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.810
Start the pursuit!

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:27.320
Yes sir!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:30.760
Cosmo!

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:32.350
You shouldn't wander around here.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.050
Lotta's going scold you again.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.050
I've got something to show you.

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:36.950
What?

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:38.800
This is the Ideon's cockpit.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.420
What the? Where'd you get this?

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:45.190
I've researched it myself. These are the controls.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:47.610
This is the missile launch button.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:49.670
I wanna fight.

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:52.760
I'm tired of being a babysitter on the Solo Ship.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:53.970
Isn't that interesting!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:54.390
Eh?

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.510
A Cosmo and Deck team.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.300
Two kids combined might pass for an adult!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.420
Kasha!

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:01.920
Using the Ideon isn't playing.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:04.290
I'm fighting desperately because I don't want to die.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.550
It's the same with Deck, right?

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:06.580
Yeah, me too.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:08.820
I'm not playing around, Cosmo.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.780
C'mon... Let me do it too!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.800
Alright.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.990
You'll need to grow accustomed to the Ideon.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:17.990
Great!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.030
This one's too big...

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:21.890
Don't you have a smaller size?

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.580
What are you two doing?

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.920
We're looking for a battle suit for me.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.010
A battle suit?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.480
I'm going to pilot the Ideon.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.730
What are you talking about, Deck?

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.120
It's okay, Lotta.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.510
He won't be a hindrance to me.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.400
We are going to make a great team.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:40.180
There's no need for you to get involved in killing.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:43.190
You should appreciate his will to fight together with us.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:46.730
Cosmo, I don't want Deck involved in this.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:50.210
Fighting isn't always righteous.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:53.320
Are you saying it's bad for me
to be fighting for everyone?!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.180
It's not a matter of good or bad...

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:59.630
You can't justify everything just with self defense.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.340
What's wrong with it?

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:11.130
Sir Damido, we'll reach the
alien ship in about 15 seconds!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.880
Good... Prepare for battle!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:14.590
Yes sir!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.300
I won't let you die in vain!

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:24.780
Make sure you take down the Giant with our hook attack!

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:25.700
Bes!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.130
Bes... I have a good idea.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.820
I'm talking to Lotta about Deck.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.930
Deck wants to pilot the Ideon.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.050
We have to stop him!

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.340
Good timing, then.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:43.120
I'd like to go to a place where we can send data to that Gloria computer on Earth...

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:45.520
We could let the children off the ship there.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.700
Lotta, you'd have nothing to worry about.

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:49.100
Bes! It's the enemy!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.230
Is it a Heavy Mobile Mecha?

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:54.750
Bes, they've entered the third battle line!

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:55.860
Fire missiles from the back!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:09.010
If the Giant comes out during the first attack wave,

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:11.190
I want you to concentrate your attack solely on it!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:19.740
The enemy?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.050
Hurry!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.000
Kasha! This is a good chance!

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:30.570
I know.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:33.190
This time we should completely
wipe out the Buff Clan.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:36.820
Then Bes will understand that we have
to be in charge of our own battles.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:37.800
That's right.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:41.170
We'll make them understand
who's guarding the Solo Ship!

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.310
This is the first time I agree with you.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.350
We might become a good team from now on.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.060
I wonder about that...

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:52.090
That brat!

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:53.290
Forget it, Cosmo.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:06.750
The Ideon Gauge!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.440
Ah... This means...

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:13.640
The energy is rising, right?

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.350
Okay! Cosmo! Go, go!

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.570
Go go, huh?

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.650
Bes! The Ideon is launching!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:23.450
Kasha! Moera! Are you ready?

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.290
Roger!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:25.270
Roger!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.120
Ideon! Go!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.100
Ah, the Giant is standing up!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:43.870
Fire!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:49.960
Come on out, Giant!

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.560
C-Cosmo!

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:57.340
The Solo Ship's barrier is covering us! Look closely.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.980
Make sure you memorize how to use the control panel, okay?

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:03.180
Launching!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.250
The Giant is coming at us!

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.350
Don't panic!

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:16.750
Use the Zurow Jicks as a shield.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.170
Zurow Jicks, get ready for the hook attack!

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.890
He wants us to do it after all!

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.240
Can we really do it?

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.830
We're not Gil Bau pilots!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.140
Just attack them with the hooks!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.540
I won't let you die! Go!

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:35.470
They're coming!

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:36.540
Right!

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.720
The enemy must want to beat us first.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:39.770
Yeah!

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:41.020
Damn it!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.200
Cosmo! They're coming from the right!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:18.630
Deck! Don't forget to watch the ten monitors!

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.950
Roger! I'm looking at them!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.650
They're coming! Right, two o'clock!

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:25.110
They're in front of us!
Cosmo!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.390
There's more of them than usual, Cosmo!

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:34.120
Kasha! Your fire is spread too thin!

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:35.880
There's two enemies at 2:30!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:36.590
Okay!

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:38.130
More units approaching behind us at six o'clock!

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:38.540
Okay!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:39.020
Hurry!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.360
They're coming! In front!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:46.950
Go!

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.670
That one just grazed us!

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:06.880
We've caught the enemy ship!

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.070
Okay. Cover Damido's unit.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:11.760
Open the main gun!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:15.890
Is it a new enemy?

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.400
It's the enemy ship!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.810
They're 2.5 subspace units away!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.590
Cosmo, did you hear that?

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.130
The enemy ship is is here!

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.830
Come protect the Solo Ship!

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.180
Can you hear me?

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:28.340
Answer me Cosmo!

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.300
Cosmo, orders from Bes!

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.700
Cosmo! Kasha!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.420
The Solo Ship is under attack.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.500
If Bes can order us around, that
 means he's better than us, right?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.770
If they're that great, they
can protect themselves!

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:44.960
Let them handle it!

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:47.670
Yeah, let's see him make an example.

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:49.400
He thinks he's so good, huh?

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:58.350
Did the Zero Zurow team forget to use the hook attack?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.440
Don't be afraid!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.400
Deck! This might be scary, but get ready!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.660
Yeah.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.000
Kasha! Let's go!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:04.850
Roger!

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:14.750
They're fast!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.620
Which one is the leader?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.500
Can't we get in closer?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.320
Sir Damido is in the middle of a battle!

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:26.320
If we get further in, we may obstruct them!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.620
Okay! Keep the Dorowa Zan here!

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.300
We'll approach the alien ship
once the Giant is defeated.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.570
It's the main engine!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:36.970
Did it get hit?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:43.590
It's alright! It's alright.

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:45.790
Cosmo and the others will protect us.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:47.260
Joliver! What's wrong?

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:49.620
The Ion Compressor's pressure is going down!

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:51.470
The beam passed right through us!

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.570
Activate the DS Drive Brake!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:56.290
The coordinates are going out of control! At this rate...

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.440
We can't back down now!

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:00.810
After the Zero Zurows have attacked with hooks,

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.250
the Zigg Macks will shoot it down!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.190
Sir Damido!

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:04.320
Oh, no!

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.980
Fine, I'll do it!

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.100
It's those wires again! Cut them off!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:31.880
Great job!

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:33.260
The Giant has stopped moving!

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:34.740
Let's go! Zigg Macks!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.570
One of our allies got destroyed!

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:42.600
We can't help it!

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:44.310
We need to hold down the Giant!

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:45.250
There's nothing we can do!

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:48.610
Ideon! Listen to me!

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:50.110
The Solo Ship is losing speed!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.810
Come back to the Solo Ship!

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:03.980
It's all over! Go to hell, Giant!

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.850
The Solo Ship is losing speed!

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.450
Losing speed?!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:12.060
Are we going to separate and
end up in another universe?

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:13.590
The Solo Ship and Ideon...

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:16.090
It... It's all over now...

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.310
Is this the end already?

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.160
No!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.330
I don't want to die here like this!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.730
I don't want to die here!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.000
Not here!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.000
Cosmo! Cosmo! Cosmo! Cosmo!

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.730
Deck! Don't die!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.350
The finishing blow!

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:52.220
Don't let it escape! Chase it!

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.750
The Giant should be weakened right now!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.850
Moera! Raise the power!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.420
Check the DS Drive, quick!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.000
Where's the Ideon?

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:12.170
I see it!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.860
I can see the Solo Ship!

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.220
Cosmo! It disappeared!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.720
Bes! Hold on!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:29.340
Damido's squadron is too close to the enemy ship!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.150
Okay.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.580
Cease fire!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.110
Leave the rest to Damido's squadron.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:37.680
Our coordinates have been stabilized!

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:39.070
Approach the Ideon!

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:42.660
I see them!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.500
Okay. I think we can do this as a team!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.800
Let's go!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:01.990
Damn the Giant!

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:03.390
Has it gained more power?

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.590
Sir Damido, the Giant went around behind us!

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:10.060
Unit Two, shield us!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.520
Damn it!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.710
Did they try to shield the Heavy Mobile Mecha?

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:22.340
What happened?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.520
Domora has caught the Giant!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:29.780
We're going to attack!

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:32.250
But Domora's Zigg Mack is too close!

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:33.840
I don't care!

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:35.920
It's coming!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.660
Fire! Shoot it down!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.690
I'm not going to die like this!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.570
Cosmo! The enemy is running away!

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:16.880
Shouldn't we chase them?

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:18.900
That's enough.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:21.270
We did defeat two of their
Heavy Mobile Mecha after all.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.260
Were you scared, Deck?

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.400
War is scary.

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:29.970
Not that, I mean getting separated from the Solo Ship.

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:30.970
Well, that's...

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:32.410
Let's head back, Kasha!

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:34.900
Yeah, let's return.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.590
Stop the DS Drive!

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:33.620
We believed that the Solo Ship
had the ability to protect itself.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.500
I'm telling the truth.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.790
But had you followed orders,

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.340
damage to the Solo Ship would
have been kept to a minimum!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.830
But defeating the Heavy Mobile
Mechas was our first priority!

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:44.800
That's right.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.780
Bes relies too much on the Ideon.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:50.620
He should think more about
protecting the Solo Ship!

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:53.050
Teamwork is the number one strategy in battle.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:57.260
In this situation, coming back would have been the right decision.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:21:00.730
We were trying to return!
Cosmo, Kasha, and Moera too.

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.710
Keep quiet, Deck.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:04.700
So, what are you gonna do?

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:08.470
As your punishment, I'll prohibit you from using the Ideon for the time being.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:09.950
That's too soft, Bes.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.140
They need a heavier penalty
for putting us all into danger.

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:13.160
We should imprison them.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:14.540
Imprison?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.890
Imprison?

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:21.920
You want to throw us in confinement in place of Karala, Ms. Sheryl?

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.770
Y... Yes.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.570
We have to make an example for the rest of the crew...

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.410
Although confinement might be too much.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:32.540
No, even though Cosmo and Kasha aren't soldiers,

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:35.200
we'll put them in solitary for ten days.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.120
Well, no use crying over it.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:38.770
You're going with me, Kasha.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:39.730
Alright.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:42.940
But you'll have to compensate for this eventually, Sheryl.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.900
I intend on doing that, Kasha.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.170
That's enough.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:54.090
It's a long story.

00:21:57.650 --> 00:21:59.020
How many meals are we gonna get?

00:21:59.020 --> 00:22:01.540
One per day. That's all.

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:05.010
It's almost like we were real criminals!

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:51.820
<i>Lou catches the measles.</i>

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:55.740
<i>In order to get a vaccine, the Solo Ship launches.</i>

00:22:55.740 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>However, they are attacked by Gije's squad,</i>

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:01.400
<i>who are using new tactics to prevent the Ideon from docking.</i>

00:23:02.390 --> 00:23:05.420
<i>In order to help Lou, Cosmo sorties.</i>

00:23:05.420 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Will the Ideon be able to dock in the end?</i>

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:15.060
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Violent Battle On The Ape Planet"</i>

